"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5088438/miquise-humphrey-grace","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mi%27Quise_Humphrey-Grace"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Mi'Quise Humphrey-Grace","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mi%27Quise_Humphrey-Grace","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:21Z","intro":"Mi'Quise Humphrey-Grace is an American college football defensive end for the Kentucky Wildcats. He previously played for the South Dakota Coyotes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Humphrey-Grace attended Princeton High School in Sharonville, Ohio. As a senior, he had 9.5 sacks. He committed to the University of South Dakota to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Humphrey-Grace played at South Dakota from 2022 to 2024. After redshirting his first year after playing in three games, he played in 13 games in 2023 and had 34 tackles, 5.5 sacks and one fumble recovery returned for a touchdown. In 2024, he was the Missouri Valley Football Conference (MVFC) Defensive Player of the Year after recording 59 tackles and a conference-leading 9.5 sacks over 14 starts. After the season, Humphrey-Grace entered the transfer portal and committed to the University of Kentucky. In his first year at Kentucky in 2025, he started all 12 games and had 31 tackles and a team leading 3.5 sacks. He returned to Kentucky as a starter in 2026."}]}}